{
  "dataset": "adversarial-corpus",
  "dataset_version": "2026-07-24.1",
  "description": "Versioned, local regression corpus for deterministic Scam Guard detectors. Cases are synthetic and contain no personal data. Malicious cases: expected_codes must all be emitted and, when present, min_severity is the minimum risk_level any single finding must reach (low < medium < high < critical). Benign cases must never raise a medium-or-above finding (RFC-002 unknown/low-only floor for controls).",
